======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 198 - Failure Day: Chaos Testing Capstones
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Assuming systems will only fail in ways predicted by unit tests.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Structured Chaos Day playbook: Predict -> Inject -> Observe -> Diagnose -> Recover -> Harden.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
